rack for our 2% price increase for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2019-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Marsh","x":"You know, we had guided to a 2% price increase for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"And we're on track to deliver $100 million cost savings, cumulatively in the next three years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2019-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"The EBIT team -- the APAC team continued to execute well with price/mix and Lean manufacturing gaining momentum across our APAC plants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2019-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"Price is up 1% for both periods compared to the same periods last year, favorably impacted obviously by our strategic price increase on 1st of April 2019, partially offset by mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2019-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Steyn","x":"Is that some of the restructuring you've done from supply chain point of view over the last 12 months coming to be there?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2019-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"And as Jack mentioned, we raised our guidance on EBIT margin as well, and added some more specificity to a range of 25% to 27% for the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2019-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"That's why we raised the guidance to 25% to 27%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q3","e":"jhx","d":"2020-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"Price was favorably impacted by our price increase on April 1 to start the year partially offset slightly by mix with both periods being up 1%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q3-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q3","e":"jhx","d":"2020-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"No. We didn't raise our price until this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q3-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q3","e":"jhx","d":"2020-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"…mindset and the strategy that we are deploying within our company using the lean principles to really drive toward producing our products with consistent quality, with predictable service and of course, to really take the unnecessary cost out of our manufacturing and supply chain system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q3-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q3","e":"jhx","d":"2020-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"We are currently on track to deliver against our lean cost out for each of the regions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q3-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q3","e":"jhx","d":"2020-02-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"Finally we raised our guidance on adjusted net operating profit to be between $350 million and $370 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q3-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2020-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack G. Truong","x":"Our pricing, you know that we had a price increase effective April 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/20/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q4-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2020-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"These included tactical cash and cost measures such as a hiring freeze, elimination of temporary and consulting-type workers, travel freeze and a reduction in discretionary spending, among others.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/20/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q4-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2020 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2020-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"We estimate that severance costs totaling approximately $10.5 million will be incurred and expensed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/20/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q4-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2020-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"This -- so we did put toward a price increase back in April and then as we guided and communicated back in the Q1 back in May and June, that we still stuck with the price increase and so the difference in -- is really about the shift in that geography.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2020-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"So that is probably the biggest effect for -- during Q1 relative to price/mix, but if you look at the total price/mix, we did have a positive, roughly a 1% increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2020-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"As we announced on May 19, we anticipated incurring approximately $10.5 million in severance costs associated with the restructuring actions we announced on May 5 and that we expected to exclude those costs from adjusted EBIT and adjusted NOPAT.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2020-08-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"We incurred a total of $11.1 million in severance costs, slightly above our $10.5 million estimate and have included them as restructuring costs in our first quarter fiscal year '21 income statement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2020-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"It is worth noting, we have shifted our annual price increase to now take place on January 1st of each year rather than April 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2020-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"This has been announced to the market and we will begin with price increase on January 1st, 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2020-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"You can see the significant improvement in our global EBIT margin shortly after we began the transformation as we translated this reduction in variability and improvement in predictability into true cost savings across our network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2020-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"Now in addition to cost savings, consistent lean execution also unlocked an incremental 12% of our operating capacity across the North American network of plants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2020-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"Today, we are reaffirming the guidance range we announced just over three weeks ago on October 14th.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2021-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"Brook we took a price increase on January 1 in North America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/20/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q4-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2021 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2021-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"That price increase went through approximately 3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/20/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q4-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2022 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2021-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"Well Andrew, our plan has always been that we do value pricing, and then so we will be taking our annual price increase about the same time every year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2022 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2021-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Truong","x":"The only difference is that, this past year, we moved our price increase up to realign with the beginning of the calendar year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/10/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q1-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2022 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2021-11-12","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Lee Power","x":"Is there any difference in conversion rates that you find when you're dealing with, like direct to consumer versus through a contractor?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/12/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2022 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2021-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Miele","x":"So your first question about January 1st price increases, we'd expect price increases to be about 5% or they are about 5% for North America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/12/james-hardie-industries-plc-jhx-q2-2022-earnings-c/"},{"c":"JHX 2025 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2025-05-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rachel Wilson","x":"With respect to tariffs, we are well-positioned with localized manufacturing to weather all potential outcomes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2025 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2025-05-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Wilson","x":"ASP rose 1% year over year, primarily related to the realization of our annual price increase, which became effective in January of 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2025 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2025-05-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Wilson","x":"ASP increased 7%, primarily driven by our June 2024 and January 2025 price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2025 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2025-05-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aaron Erter","x":"We have a solid plan to expand our margins in Europe, comprised of purposeful investment to drive operating leverage alongside sales growth and to generate cost savings by optimizing our production footprint and driving efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2025 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2025-05-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aaron Erter","x":"The value proposition of ColorPlus enables contractors and home builders to create beautiful, distinguished homes with superior aesthetics, customization, and durability, in addition to offering time and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/20/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2025-08-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Wilson","x":"As we anticipated, price realization improved sequentially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/19/james-hardie-jhx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2025-08-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Wilson","x":"Encouragingly, we continue to expect our disciplined value-driven pricing approach to yield solid price realization throughout FY2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/19/james-hardie-jhx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2025-08-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aaron Erter","x":"Our innovation strategies also apply to the installation process for our homebuilder and contractor partners, which again includes ColorPlus, offering time and cost savings, particularly in areas with constrained labor availability and higher painting costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/19/james-hardi