 year over year, The key drivers of the comparable change in margins were positive price, mix and ongoing cost savings, These were partially offset by lower volumes, unfavorable absorption, and inflation in freight and raw materials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/james-hardie-jhx-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q3","e":"jhx","d":"2026-02-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"For Siding and Trim adjusted EBITDA we are modestly raising our guidance range to $939,000,000 to $962,000,000 At the midpoints, this implies a full year organic net sales decline of approximately 6% and an adjusted EBITDA margin of 31.9%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/james-hardie-jhx-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2026-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Aaron Erter","x":"And, look, from a pricing standpoint, we are taking price to offset inflation and also to hold our margins here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2026-05-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"I think as we talked about before, you know, on the fiber you side, we would expect it to be a little more than 3% in terms of price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2026-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"Across both siding and trim, Entegra and accessories, pricing actions, plant cost savings, and cost synergies are all driving in the same direction on margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2026 Q4","e":"jhx","d":"2026-05-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"You know, cost savings and things outside of that $25 million we quoted for the plant closures would be outside of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/19/james-hardie-jhx-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2027 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Bouley","x":"But my question is on often in this industry, when you have price increases, you might see some pre-buys and things like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/james-hardie-jhx-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2027 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"Separately, the $25 million in annualized fiscal year 2027 savings from our Fontana and Summerville plant closures, along with continued cost savings across sourcing, productivity and formulation, are tracking as planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/james-hardie-jhx-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2027 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"Adjusted EBITDA margin was 33.5%, reflecting volume leverage, pricing and continued plant cost savings from our manufacturing footprint optimization work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/james-hardie-jhx-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2027 Q1","e":"jhx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"Given our first quarter performance, we are raising our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/james-hardie-jhx-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"JHX 2027 Q2","e":"jhx","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ryan Lada","x":"And then we did do a modest midyear price increase that was pretty selective across certain products and that helped absorb some of the pain as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/james-hardie-